{"id":"n61092-1-5","stage":3,"title":"끄덕이다 · 点头","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n61092-1-5-1","ko":"고개만 끄덕이지 말고 대답을 해. 이제 다시는 안 그럴 거지?","zh":"别只是点头，要回答啊。以后不会再这样做了吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"고개만","meaning":"头，脑袋","explanation":"고개：头，脑袋；만：表示“只、仅”。","readings":[{"term":"고개","audio":"/audio/44adfe36e1f5e4fe0260.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62501","senseId":"1","lemma":"고개","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"끄덕이지","meaning":"点头","explanation":"끄덕이다：点头；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。","readings":[{"term":"끄덕이다","audio":"/audio/01d6e50160c85cd57346.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61092","senseId":"1","lemma":"끄덕이다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"말고","meaning":"不要做、停止做（-지 말다）","explanation":"말다：不要做、停止做（-지 말다）；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"말다","audio":"/audio/f8b54c8d9bfb2043a3b8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72580","senseId":"1","lemma":"말다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"대답을","meaning":"回答，解答","explanation":"대답：回答，解答；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"대답","audio":"/audio/bd8a8d233373a1c01779.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64540","senseId":"2","lemma":"대답","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"해.","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이제","meaning":"今后","explanation":"이제：今后","readings":[{"term":"이제","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61172","senseId":"2","lemma":"이제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다시는","meaning":"再也","explanation":"다시：再也；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"다시","audio":"/audio/920b0d402f08f1fbae95.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62539","senseId":"7","lemma":"다시","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그럴","meaning":"那样子","explanation":"그러다：那样子；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"그러다","audio":"/audio/5cc953af09d8c68cfb6d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"37062","senseId":"1","lemma":"그러다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"거지?","meaning":"表示说话人的确信、决定、决心等。","explanation":"거：表示说话人的确信、决定、决心等。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"4","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"44adfe36e1f5e4fe","term":"고개","zh":"头，脑袋","audio":"/audio/44adfe36e1f5e4fe0260.mp3","entryId":"62501","definition":"包括脖子在内的头部。","pronunciation":["고개"]},{"id":"01d6e50160c85cd5","term":"끄덕이다","zh":"点头","audio":"/audio/01d6e50160c85cd57346.mp3","entryId":"61092","definition":"把头上下微微晃动。","pronunciation":["끄더기다"]},{"id":"f8b54c8d9bfb2043","term":"말다","zh":"不要做、停止做（-지 말다）","audio":"/audio/f8b54c8d9bfb2043a3b8.mp3","entryId":"72580","definition":"不要做、停止做（-지 말다）","pronunciation":["말ː다"]},{"id":"bd8a8d233373a1c0","term":"대답","zh":"回答，解答","audio":"/audio/bd8a8d233373a1c01779.mp3","entryId":"64540","definition":"对问或要求的事情做出相应的答复；或指那样的话。","pronunciation":["대ː답"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"16ebe2403bccd648","term":"이제","zh":"今后","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3","entryId":"61172","definition":"从今以后。","pronunciation":["이제"]},{"id":"920b0d402f08f1fb","term":"다시","zh":"再也","audio":"/audio/920b0d402f08f1fbae95.mp3","entryId":"62539","definition":"以后再。","pronunciation":["다시"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"5cc953af09d8c68c","term":"그러다","zh":"那样子","audio":"/audio/5cc953af09d8c68cfb6d.mp3","entryId":"37062","definition":"像前面发生过的事或说过的话一样地做。","pronunciation":["그러다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"表示说话人的确信、决定、决心等。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"表示说话人的确信、决定、决心等。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/9c31d5236aaaa356e1f3.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n61092-1-5-2","ko":"네. 안 그럴게요.","zh":"嗯，我不会再这样做了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네.","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"네：是，行","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"2","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그럴게요.","meaning":"那样子","explanation":"그러다：那样子；ㄹ게：向对方表达说话人的决定或承诺，非敬语。；요：增加礼貌语气。","readings":[{"term":"그러다","audio":"/audio/5cc953af09d8c68cfb6d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"37062","senseId":"1","lemma":"그러다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1c0ddfd005093840","term":"네","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3","entryId":"17294","definition":"用于肯定回答长辈所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["네"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"5cc953af09d8c68c","term":"그러다","zh":"那样子","audio":"/audio/5cc953af09d8c68cfb6d.mp3","entryId":"37062","definition":"像前面发生过的事或说过的话一样地做。","pronunciation":["그러다"]}],"audio":"/audio/f4c9da9f2d6dab905b60.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.815,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=61092","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":99,"sequenceScore":2.6417,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["别只是点头，要回答啊。以后不会再这样做了吧？","嗯，我不会再这样做了。","哇，花园里开了数千朵玫瑰花呢。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["别只是点头，要回答啊。以后不会再这样做了吧？","嗯，我不会再这样做了。","哇，花园里开了数千朵玫瑰花呢。"],"answer":1}]}
